@node Top
@top Vernier

Vernier arranges, rotates, scales and mirrors displays on Linux.  It
replaces wdisplays on Wayland and ARandR on X11 with one program that
has a graphical editor and a scriptable command line.

@insertcopying
@end ifnottex

